          "title": "Pyrefly",
          "content": "<p><img src=\"https://cdn.beekka.com/blogimg/asset/202505/bg2025051801.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" /></p>\n<p>Meta 公司发布的 Python 代码的类型检查器，参见<a href=\"https://engineering.fb.com/2025/05/15/developer-tools/introducing-pyrefly-a-new-type-checker-and-ide-experience-for-python/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">介绍文章</a>。</p>",
          "links": [
            {
              "text": "Pyrefly",
              "url": "https://github.com/facebook/pyrefly/"
            },
            {
              "text": "介绍文章",
              "url": "https://engineering.fb.com/2025/05/15/developer-tools/introducing-pyrefly-a-new-type-checker-and-ide-experience-for-python/"
            }
